## shadcn/ui + Tailwind Conventions

- Use `components.json` aliases: `@/components`, `@/components/ui`, `@/lib/utils`.
- Generate UI via shadcn registry compatible with Tailwind CSS using `src/styles/globals.css`.
- Components must be structured with clear props and a JSX return. Export React components as named exports.
- Expose `className` and merge via `cn()`.
- Use Tailwind semantic classes bound to tokens: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `ring-ring`.
- Variants use `data-*` attributes or `aria-*` states; avoid hard-coded colors.
- Prefer `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring` for focus styles.
- Respect radius tokens: `rounded-sm|md|lg|xl` mapped to `--radius-*`.
- Use `@layer` utilities sparingly; rely on tokens and shadcn/ui primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Label`, `Textarea`, `Form`).
- Keep animation utilities using `tw-animate-css` when needed; avoid custom keyframes unless required.

### Theming

- Apply theme through `ThemeProvider` from `next-themes` with `attribute="class"`.
- Do not theme per component; rely on global tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`.

### Accessibility

- Ensure keyboard navigability. Use semantic HTML, ARIA attributes, and proper label/input associations.
